  "details": "Description\n\nFor some reason whenever I want to clone someones avatar, it says their avatar cloning isn't on when it clearly is. I tried to clone off of one of my friends but on my screen it showed that their cloning wasn't on and many other people could see their cloning on except for me. I'm not sure if it's a bug or not but please let me know, this has been happening for a few days now.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nI think it could be avatar cloning issues, i'm not so sure myself.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Avatar\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-15_18-18-54.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_69658873-3250-4f1c-b2f9-98acd750814f/1/file)",
